# Mouse cradle with SOLID side walls, polyethylene, for the SENSITIVITY runs, moving with the source
# (made 4 Nov 2026 by coil_bed_real/make_mbed3mm.py from the map-derived mouse cradle, stl/ and stl80/ mbed_s00NN).
# 5 Nov 2026: the STLs' end caps were re-triangulated (edge flips by coil_bed_real/fix_mbed3mm_caps.py in GATE
# Sensitivity Test; vertices, side walls, volume and cross-sections unchanged) to remove 6 zero-area and 126 sliver
# cap facets, which gave GeomSolids1001/1002, overlap reports of 1e-9 ... 1e-7 mm and GeomNav1002 in GATE.
# User, 4-5 Nov 2026: the real mouse bed's side walls are solid (no gaps or steps), 3 mm thick; mouse and rat bed are
# the same material, white and opaque (not PMMA), probably polyethylene.
# Per part (same 10 parts, z ranges and own frame as the map-derived mouse cradle):
#  * floor (below the floor top, y = -12.055 mm in the cradle's own frame): unchanged, channels included;
#  * side walls: same shape, inclination and inner surface as the map-derived cradle, with the gaps/notches
#    of the outer surface closed (outer surface = convex envelope of the old cross-section); the steep drop
#    from the wall to the floor (below y = -8 mm) is rounded so the wall is 3 mm thick there (the flat floor
#    top is now |x| < ~6.4 mm instead of ~10 mm). Wall thickness normal to the wall: >= 3.00 mm below
#    y = -8 mm, median ~3.5 mm above, 2.2 mm at the thinnest point near the top end (shape kept there).
#    Largest radius unchanged, so the cradle fits both coils as before.
#    See coil_bed_real/mbed3mm_cross_sections.png (grey: map-derived, red: this cradle).
#  * material: Bed_HDPE (polyethylene C2H4, 0.95 g/cm3, defined in coil_bed_real/Coil3Bed.db), ASSUMED from the colour;
#    instead of the map value AC_Plastic_0744 (0.80 g/cm3 as C5H8O2, mu 0.0744 /cm at 511 keV), which is lower than
#    any solid plastic and belongs to the map's own (thicker) geometry. If the material turns out different, change
#    the 10 setMaterial lines (e.g. POM 1.41, nylon 1.14 g/cm3).
# Every part is placed at (0, {cradleY}, {sourceZ}): {cradleY} from the main macro, {sourceZ} from its
# RUN SETTINGS. Used by Sens_main_real.mac, setups q86 and q35.

/gate/world/daughters/name mbed3mm_s0087
/gate/world/daughters/insert tessellated
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/geometry/setPathToSTLFile coil_bed_real/stl_mbed3mm/mbed3mm_s0087.stl
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/setMaterial Bed_HDPE
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/placement/setTranslation 0 {cradleY} {sourceZ} mm
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/vis/setColor white
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/attachPhantomSD

